@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Index";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/TMSLayout.cshtml";
}

<style>
  /*  body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background: #f5f7fa;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
    }*/
    h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, #cc2b5e, #753a88);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text; /* For Firefox */
        color: transparent;
    }

    ul {
        list-style: none;
        padding-left: 0;
    }

    ul li {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    p {
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .scroll-container {
        width: 100%;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin: 40px 0;
        position: relative;
    }

    .scroll-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        width: calc(600px * 8 + 160px);
        animation: scroll-left 30s linear infinite;
    }

    .scroll-inner {
        display: flex;
        gap: 20px;
    }

    .scroll-inner img {
        width: 600px;
        height: 400px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        transition: transform 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s;
    }

    .scroll-inner img:hover {
        transform: scale(1.08);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    @@keyframes scroll-left {
        0% {
            transform: translateX(0);
        }
        100% {
            transform: translateX(-50%);
        }
    }

    /* Optional: Responsive Image Scaling */
    @@media (max-width: 768px) {
        .scroll-inner img {
            width: 300px;
            height: 200px;
        }

        .scroll-wrapper {
            width: calc(300px * 8 + 160px);
        }
    }
</style>

<h2>Welcome to <b>Waleed TMS</b> – Streamline Your Logistics Like Never Before.</h2>

<p>Efficiently manage your transportation operations with our all-in-one TMS platform. From planning and execution to tracking and reporting, our system offers end-to-end solutions tailored to meet the unique needs of your business.</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Optimize Routes:</strong> Leverage advanced algorithms to reduce costs and improve delivery times.</li>
    <li><strong>Real-Time Tracking:</strong> Monitor shipments in real-time for greater visibility and control.</li>
    <li><strong>Customizable Dashboards:</strong> Access critical data at a glance with personalized dashboards.</li>
    <li><strong>Seamless Integration:</strong> Connect with your existing systems for a unified workflow.</li>
    <li><strong>Scalable Solutions:</strong> Grow your business with a platform that scales with your needs.</li>
</ul>

<p>Experience the future of transportation management with our intuitive and powerful TMS. Start your journey toward smarter logistics today.</p>

